Package: localloc
Title: Facility Location Optimization Models in R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Philippe", "Apparicio", , "philippe.apparicio@usherbrooke.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Samuel", "Foucher", , "samuel.foucher@gmail.com", role = "ctb"),
    person("Marie-Hélène", "Gadbois Del Carpio", role = "ctb"))
Description: Implements ten facility-location optimization models
    (P-Median, P-Center, MCLP, LSCP, UFCLP, CFLP, DP, UFLP, MAXCAP,
    PMAXCAP) as integer linear programs, built as sparse matrices and
    solved directly via Rglpk or highs.
